%% Sequence diagram 2: the kitchen opens the prep plan and accepts or overrides a recommendation.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor K as Food Production Manager
  participant B as Browser (Vue page)
  participant C as API controller /api/v1/recommendations
  participant RS as RecommendationService
  participant FS as ForecastingService
  participant D as MySQL 8.4

  K->>B: open Prep plan for a date
  B->>C: GET /recommendations/prep?date=D
  C->>C: session valid? role in (kitchen, admin)?
  C->>RS: get_prep_plan(outlet, D)
  RS->>FS: forecast_map(outlet, D, D)
  FS->>D: SELECT latest forecasts
  RS->>D: safety buffer setting, confirmed pre-orders, batch sizes, decisions so far
  RS-->>C: rows: forecast, buffer, pre-orders, recommended = ceil(max(f x (1+b), pre) / batch) x batch
  C-->>B: 200 {"data": ...}
  B-->>K: cards with the numbers behind each recommendation
  alt accept
    K->>B: Accept
    B->>C: POST /recommendations/prep/decisions {item, date, action: accept} + CSRF token
  else override
    K->>B: Override with quantity and reason
    B->>C: POST /recommendations/prep/decisions {item, date, action: override, final_qty, reason} + CSRF token
  end
  C->>RS: decide(outlet, data, user)
  RS->>RS: validate fields, date not in the past, item active
  RS->>FS: forecast_map(outlet, D, D)
  alt no forecast for that date
    RS-->>C: ValidationError (no_forecast)
    C-->>B: 422 with field errors
  else forecast exists
    RS->>RS: recompute recommended, warn if final < confirmed pre-orders
    RS->>D: UPSERT recommendations (status, final_qty, reason, decided_by)
    RS->>D: INSERT audit_logs
    RS-->>C: decision (+ warnings)
    C-->>B: 200 {"data": ...}
    B-->>K: card shows Accepted / Overridden
  end
